{"id":"steam-721450","steam":721450,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Cardboard Invasion","summary":"Cardboard Invasion is a FPS Tower Defense game set in the world of imagination. Set out on an adventure on your own or with friends to defend Cardboard Land from invading forces by constructing defensive towers, calling in reinforcements, equipping special weapons and more...","about":"In a distant land in another dimension where imagination runs wild, there is a war going on. Cardboard Invaders are scheming to take over the happy lands of Cardboard Land.\r\nCardboard Invasion is a 1-4 player action first-person shooter Tower Defense game for players that love shooting but also strategizing. Players get to play as ex-military cardboard engineers, forced back into battle by an invasion on their homeland. Construct towers to destroy the incoming waves of soldiers, tanks, mechs and more.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\nSolo Campaign or 2-4 player cooperative gameplay that puts you and your teammates through the ultimate cooperation and communication test.\r\nExplore the cardboard world, built from every day objects we find in our world.\r\n\r\nUse the map to plan for the next wave, build and upgrade towers to fit your defensive needs. You will have to work closely with your team mates to survive the incoming waves of attack.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/721450/library_600x900.jpg?t=1673500763","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/721450/header.jpg?t=1673500763","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/721450/library_hero.jpg?t=1673500763","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/721450/header.jpg?t=1673500763","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/721450/ss_8528b2af54be52726e28d279d65ec69b7933e174.600x338.jpg?t=1673500763","full":"https://shar